      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/rockville_alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rockville sits at 31°25′13″N 87°50′33″W, 308 feet above sea level, on the eastern bank of the Tombigbee River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
